sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor / User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Laravel API
    participant DB as Database
    V->>F: Open the landing / pricing page
    F->>A: GET /api/pricing
    A->>DB: Read active plans (is_active = true)
    A-->>F: 200 { plans } (cached 10 min, Cache-Control)
    F->>A: GET /api/testimonials
    A->>DB: Read approved testimonials
    A-->>F: 200 { testimonials }
    F-->>V: Render offers (monthly / yearly) + testimonials
